        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Each solution begins with a repeated problem in technology
            operations: evidence that is difficult to trace, mail that is
            expensive to review, files that have lost their context, designs
            that reach review with unresolved gaps, or administrative work that
            is difficult to reverse.
          </p>
          <p>
            The common design rule is straightforward. Automation can prepare,
            organize, and carry work, but important decisions remain reviewable
            and owned by a person.
          </p>
          <p>
            Separate from these, Tectori publishes
            <a class="text-link" href="/tools">free, open source tools</a>
            that anyone can download and use today.
          </p>
